NutritionFacts.org is a
science-based non-profit,

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.760
and everything on
the website is free.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:59.360
There are no ads, no corporate
sponsorships, no kickbacks.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.720
Strictly non-commercial,
not selling anything.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:04.400
I just put up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.880
as a tribute to my grandmother

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:10.640
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.480
Thanks for listening.

